"authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_Agents/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_Agents/", "title": "LangChain Agent", "content_html": "<h1>LangChain Agent</h1>\n<p>LangChain\uacfc \uc21c\uc218 SDK\ub97c \ube44\uad50\ud560 \ub54c \uc758\uc874 \ube44\uc6a9\uc774 \uac00\uc7a5 \ud06c\uac8c \ub098\uc624\ub294 \uacf3\uc774 \uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8\ub2e4. \ub2e8\uc77c \ud638\ucd9c\uc740 \ub798\ud37c \ud55c \uacb9\uc774\uc9c0\ub9cc, \uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8\ub294 \ub8e8\ud504\uc758 \uc885\ub8cc \ud310\ub2e8, \uc5d0\ub7ec \ucc98\ub9ac, \uc0c1\ud0dc \ubcf4\uad00\uc744 \ud504\ub808\uc784\uc6cc\ud06c\uac00 \uc950\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4. \uc774 \ubb38\uc11c\ub294 AgentExecutor\uac00 \uadf8 ...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-10-19T15:14:17+00:00", "date_published": "2026-09-07T04:04:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_LCEL/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_LCEL/", "title": "LCEL (LangChain Expression Language)", "content_html": "<h1>LCEL \u2014 LangChain Expression Language</h1>\n<p>LCEL\uc740 LangChain 0.1 \uc2dc\uc808\uc758 <code>LLMChain</code>, <code>SequentialChain</code> \uac19\uc740 \ub808\uac70\uc2dc \uccb4\uc778\uc744 \ub300\uccb4\ud558\ub294 \uc870\ud569 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc774\ub2e4. \ud30c\uc774\ud504(<code>|</code>)\ub85c \ucef4\ud3ec\ub10c\ud2b8\ub97c \uc5f0\uacb0\ud558\uba74 \ub0b4\ubd80\uc5d0\uc11c `RunnableSeq...</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-10-19T14:58:57+00:00", "date_published": "2026-09-07T04:04:35+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_vs_SDK/", "url": "https://gyutory.github.io/YGSTUDY/AI/Concepts/Lang_Chain_vs_SDK/", "title": "LangChain vs \uc21c\uc218 SDK", "content_html": "<p>!!! warning \"\ube60\ub974\uac8c \ub0a1\ub294 \ubb38\uc11c\"\n    \uc774 \uc8fc\uc81c\ub294 \ub9b4\ub9ac\uc2